# Debug/test scripts
# NOTE: these patterns target throwaway scratch scripts in the repo root, NOT the
# real test suite. They are anchored to the root (leading /) so that
# backend/tests/test_*.py is tracked — an unanchored `test_*.py` silently ignored
# every pytest file ever written, which is why backend/tests/ stayed empty.
/debug_*.py
/explore_*.py
/test_*.py
/fix_*.py
/reset_*.py
validate_usm.ps1
*_sync.tar

# Build artifacts
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Generated reports (produced by scripts/generate_capacity_report.py)
/usm_capacity_report.xlsx
